# The Beginner two-stream route of Spore Hollow in co-op (designer D6; recorded from build/d6/bot_w6_l2_coop.gd, P1|P2):
# gate 'seesaw' (P2 springs onto the cap ledge and drops on the high end, P1 flies up and unrolls the vine, P2
# climbs it), the geyser and the shelf passage one after the other, gate 'caps' (P1 at the floor drum, P2 on the
# cap ledge, both strike on the same tick), the lower hall and the team exit. Club only, never S.
# Re-recorded for the idle rule (G33): a role that waits taps Down (a crouch) after 150 quiet ticks.
# Re-recorded in wf11 (levels) with the same bot on the rebuilt file: the hall's rock reaches over the cap ledge
# (3 rows over it), so nobody's feet come level with the passage from it; the gate's play is unchanged.
